sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Source as Fuente de monitoreo
    participant Controller as EventIngestionController
    participant Auth as IEventSourceAuthenticator
    participant Service as EventIngestionService
    participant Validator as IIngestionEventValidator
    participant IngestionRepo as IEventIngestionRepository
    participant OutboxPublisher as OutboxPublisher
    participant OutboxRepo as IOutboxRepository
    participant EventPublisher as IEventPublisher
    participant Bus as Bus de Mensajería

    Source->>Controller: Enviar evento de monitoreo
    activate Controller

    Controller->>Auth: AuthenticateAsync(request)
    activate Auth
    Auth-->>Controller: EventSourceAuthenticationResult<br/>IsAuthenticated = true
    deactivate Auth

    Controller->>Controller: MapToEvent(request)

    Controller->>Service: AcceptAsync(event)
    activate Service

    Service->>Validator: Validate(event)
    activate Validator
    Validator-->>Service: EventValidationResult<br/>IsValid = true
    deactivate Validator

    Service->>Service: Crear OutboxMessage<br/>Status = Pending

    Service->>IngestionRepo: AcceptAsync(event, outboxMessage)
    activate IngestionRepo

    Note over IngestionRepo: MonitoringEvent y OutboxMessage<br/>se persisten en una misma transacción.

    IngestionRepo->>IngestionRepo: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    IngestionRepo->>IngestionRepo: Persistir MonitoringEvent
    IngestionRepo->>IngestionRepo: Persistir OutboxMessage
    IngestionRepo->>IngestionRepo: COMMIT

    IngestionRepo-->>Service: EventPersistenceResult<br/>Status = Accepted
    deactivate IngestionRepo

    Service-->>Controller: EventIngestionResult<br/>Status = Accepted
    deactivate Service

    Controller-->>Source: Evento aceptado durablemente
    deactivate Controller

    Note over Source,Bus: El evento ya está preservado.<br/>La publicación ocurre posteriormente.

    OutboxPublisher->>OutboxRepo: GetPendingAsync()
    activate OutboxRepo
    OutboxRepo-->>OutboxPublisher: OutboxMessageCollection
    deactivate OutboxRepo

    OutboxPublisher->>EventPublisher: PublishAsync(outboxMessage)
    activate EventPublisher

    EventPublisher->>Bus: Publicar Payload
    activate Bus
    Bus-->>EventPublisher: Timeout / indisponibilidad temporal
    deactivate Bus

    EventPublisher--xOutboxPublisher: Falla de publicación
    deactivate EventPublisher

    OutboxPublisher->>OutboxRepo: RegisterFailureAsync(messageId, reason)
    activate OutboxRepo
    OutboxRepo-->>OutboxPublisher: Fallo registrado
    deactivate OutboxRepo

    Note over OutboxPublisher,OutboxRepo: AttemptCount se incrementa y se registra la causa.<br/>El mensaje permanece Pending para reintento.

    Note over OutboxPublisher,Bus: En una ejecución posterior, OutboxPublisher<br/>volverá a recuperar e intentar publicar el mensaje.